  "title": "Black Walnut Cake",
  "description": "I got this recipe from an old Army mess hall sergeant who later became a chef down in Savannah, GA. This is a wonderful, different nut cake that is equally good served warm or cold.",
  "authors": [
    "Patricia Canerdy"
  ],
